            <div class="res-content">
              <div class="res-name"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLbgaMIhjbmEnaH_LTkxLI7FMa2HsnawM_" target="_blank" class="res-link">Bartosz Milewski — Category Theory for Programmers (YouTube) <span class="res-link-arrow">&nearr;</span></a></div>
              <div class="res-desc">Free lecture series that teaches category theory through the lens of programming (Haskell). Milewski makes abstract concepts concrete with code examples. If you are coming from a CS background, this is your entry point into category theory before tackling Riehl's book.</div>
