            <div class="res-icon">&#9670;</div>
            <div class="res-content">
              <div class="res-name">AlphaFold and the AI-for-Science revolution</div>
              <div class="res-desc">DeepMind's AlphaFold solved protein structure prediction — a 50-year grand challenge in biology — using deep learning constrained by physical and evolutionary priors. This is the template for AI-for-science: domain knowledge (biology/physics) + deep learning + massive computation. Study the AlphaFold2 paper (Jumper et al., Nature 2021) and the open-source code to understand how polymathic AI systems are built. Similarly, study DeepMind's GNoME for materials discovery and weather prediction models like GraphCast.</div>
