            <div class="res-content">
              <div class="res-name"><a href="https://julia.mit.edu/" target="_blank" class="res-link">MIT "Introduction to Computational Thinking" with Julia (free) <span class="res-link-arrow">&nearr;</span></a></div>
              <div class="res-desc">Free MIT course using Julia for scientific computing. Julia is purpose-built for numerical computing — as fast as C, as readable as Python. The course covers: image processing, climate modeling, optimization, and differential equations, all with interactive Julia notebooks. An excellent entry into scientific computing for someone coming from the Python ML world.</div>
