      <div class="track-title">The Synthesis Layer — becoming more than the sum of your parts</div>
      <div class="track-sub">Knowledge in separate domains is a library. Knowledge connected across domains is an engine. This final tab is about the synthesis — how to deliberately connect your domains, build at intersections, publish interdisciplinary work, and construct a polymath identity that compounds over decades. This is where the program transforms from "learning a lot" into "becoming someone rare."</div>
