              <div class="res-desc">Build a fluid dynamics or N-body simulation using classical numerical methods, then train a neural network to accelerate it (neural operators, PINNs). Requires: physics (PDEs, conservation laws), mathematics (numerical analysis), CS (efficient implementation), and ML (network design, training). Deploy as an interactive web visualization. Domains touched: 4.</div>
