              <div class="res-desc">Build a physical or simulated robot that uses computer vision for perception, RL for decision-making, and classical control for low-level actuation. Requires: robotics (kinematics, ROS2), ML (CNNs for vision, RL for policy), control systems (PID for motors), embedded systems (hardware interface), and software engineering (the system integration). Domains touched: 5.</div>
