              <div class="res-name">AI-powered scientific discovery tool</div>
              <div class="res-desc">Build a tool that uses ML to accelerate scientific research in a specific domain: drug discovery (chemistry + ML), materials science (physics + ML), mathematical conjecture generation (math + ML), or automated theorem proving (logic + ML). Study the existing literature (AlphaFold, GNoME, Llemma), then build your own version for a niche domain. Domains touched: 3-5 depending on the domain.</div>
